","text":"You don’t need to tick every single box. Focus on the experiences, skills and motivations that truly connect you to the role and tell your story in your own words."},{"id":266,"heading":"Get to know Allwyn.","text":"Take some time to explore who we are, what we do and how we work together. \n\nUnderstanding our culture and values will help you decide if Allwyn feels like the right fit for you, too."},{"id":267,"heading":"Prepare, but don’t over-rehearse.","text":"Think about examples from your experience that show how you work, collaborate and take ownership. Authentic beats perfect every time."},{"id":268,"heading":"Ask questions.","text":"Interviews are a two-way conversation. Whether it’s about the role, the team or how we work, thoughtful questions are always welcome."},{"id":269,"heading":"Need adjustments or accommodations?","text":"Just let your recruiter know. We’re committed to creating an inclusive and accessible recruitment process and will do our best to support you."},{"id":270,"heading":"And finally: be yourself.","text":"We’re not looking for a “perfect” candidate – we’re looking for real people who want to grow, make an impact and do great things together."}],"__component":"modules.text-items-module"}]}],"meta":{"pagination":{"page":1,"pageSize":1,"pageCount":1,"total":1}}}